  "TOPIC TRIVIA — Movies & TV. Each team answers FIVE questions at its own proficiency level. Start the 150-second timer before showing both teams' cards. Each team works separately and writes its answers. Check the answers after time expires.": "Hold mod hold. Begge hold svarer hver for sig på fem spørgsmål om emnet. Ved samme niveau ser de DET SAMME kort, ellers får de niveau-tilpassede kort.",
